E685: CA 90 E6            488 |     JZ  TRFCB3  ; Go set transient disk.
E688: 1B                  489 |     DCX D   ; Get current logged in disk number.
E689: 3A EF EB            490 | TRFCB2: LDA CURDSK  ;
