EAFB: D2 71 EB           1221 |     JNC LDERR   ; ERROR CONDITION, PROGRAM TOO BIG FOR MEMORY.
EAFE: C3 E1 EA           1222 |     JMP TRANS2  ; BACK FOR NEXT SECTOR.
                         1223 | ;
EB01: E1                 1224 | TRANS3: POP H   ; CLEAR STACK.
